Hi, no, I can't share the project. But your note helped me figure it out.

It seems like packrat is doing a search for "library" and "require" in any R file in any subdirectory. That explained why Rcmdr was getting loaded -- it's in an "old/" directory.

>From there, I figure out that you're doing some sort of regexes or something to find packages to include. I've got a tricky bit in one file that I figured out was causing you to look for "pkg":

